        {
            "jpName": "",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "『毎日王冠』を無事に走り終え戻ってきた\nステイゴールド。しかし彼女はどこか、\n神妙な面持ちでいた……。",
            "enText": "Stay Gold returned with no trouble after \nrunning in the Mainichi Okan. Though, \nsomehow her face reflected a solemn \nexpression.",
            "nextBlock": 21,
            "origClipLength": 111,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "……何かあったのか？",
                    "enText": "……Did something happen?",
                    "nextBlock": 21
                },
                {
                    "jpText": "……何かあったの？",
                    "enText": "……Did something happen?",
                    "nextBlock": 21
