            "jpName": "ステイゴールド",
            "enName": "Stay Gold",
            "jpText": "……どうも、いよいよ来たらしい。\nこの旅の、本当の“嵐”が。",
            "enText": "……So it seems, the time has finally arrived. \nThe true \"storm\" for this journey to reach.",
