            "pathId": -3154363961951092254,
            "blockIdx": 22
        },
        {
            "jpName": "",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "クラシック級のウマ娘とは思えないほどの、\n圧倒的な走り。見ていて恐ろしくなるほどの\n成長速度だというのが、正直な印象だった。",
            "enText": "Her run today brought about an absolutely \noverwhelming aura. I never expected that a \nhorsegirl in the Classics could ever grow to \nthis stage so tremendously quickly.",
            "nextBlock": 24,
            "origClipLength": 125,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 136,
                    "pathId": 5307934336812289127
