            "enText": "For \"The Ones Who Shine\", it's the twinkles \nthey leave behind that are etched into my \n\"memories\", that moment where they \nbecome their most dazzling selves ——",
            "nextBlock": 27,
            "origClipLength": 98,
            "voiceIdx": 88,
