            "pathId": 4687667328175095858,
            "blockIdx": 26
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ステイゴールド",
            "enName": "Stay Gold",
            "jpText": "……ま、ある種の\n最盛期みたいなもんだと思ってくれ。",
            "enText": "……Well, think of it as the moment \na seed bursts into flower.",
